      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Embedding Provider**\n\nOkay, I'm setting up a Python script, `embed_text.py`, to generate embeddings. I've decided to go with OpenAI and their `text-embedding-ada-002` model, so I need to clearly define that as the external provider within the code.\n\n\n**Specifying Embedding Source**\n\nI'm now concretely defining OpenAI and the `text-embedding-ada-002` model within the `embed_text.py` script. The goal is to make the external provider clear. I am going to make sure to create the Python file and add the code to generate the embeddings using the OpenAI SDK. Finally, the OpenAI API key is being included as an environment variable to ensure secure access.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865594134,
          "start": 1789865592627
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc4d8733001cpuDESGb0JD4Vf",
